 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Back to the 70's
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: You need the foot-pedal and a expression pedal.
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 21
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A       132546
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       1325*6
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       ****5*
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 0
 SUSTAIN 80
   LEVEL 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-2  	a. DISTORTION
 
       TONE 0
 DISTORTION 41
      LEVEL 60
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-3 PICKING FILTER
 
        SENS 22
 CUTOFF FREQ 25
           Q 4.5
     UP/DOWN UP

 ----------------------------------
 A-4 STEP PHASER
 
 RATE
 DEPTH
 MANUAL
 RESONANCE
 LFO STEP
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 6.06 kHz
   HI LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 4.00 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 1.00 kHz
     L.M. Q 1.9
 L.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
    LO FREQ 60 Hz
   LO LEVEL +7.0 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +6.0 dB

----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 2.4 sec
 
 MODE: SPRING 2
 
    CUTOFF THRU
 PRE DELAY 25 msec
  E. LEVEL 18
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 55
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
   ASSIGN P.FILTER--C.FREQ
 
   DEVICE PEDAL
 
 LFO RATE
 
     MAX: CUTOFF FREQ=100
 
     MIN: CUTOFF FREQ=15
 
 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

